OL,3,GNEWSARail disaster of 1957 marked by St
OL,4,AJohn's plaque
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the community and the St
OL,7,FJohn's Society gathered at the station
OL,8,Fon Saturday for the unveiling of the
OL,9,Fmemorial. The event included speeches,
OL,10,Fchoral performances and readings and
OL,11,Fmusic.
